<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="Ch.3 wavelength selection pitfall (acetic acid NIR)" description="1 mm, SG 9/2/d2, 88 wavelengths with A &lt; 1.5. (A) Rank picks the best wavelength with all 4 samples, then Leave one out; (B) Preprocess 'Select Relevant Features' on the Preprocessor input of Test and Score re-selects inside every fold. Data: ../../data/spectra_wide_orange.csv">
